values ('bacc1010-2015-4000-8000-000000000006', 'kh-grade12-science-mathematics-differential-equations', null, 2015, 'open', 'គេមានសមីការឌីផេរ៉ង់ស្យែល $(E)$៖ $y''+2y=2\dfrac{e^{-x}}{1+2e^x}$។
